pt100> help
help  [<string>] [-v <0|1>]
  Print the summary of all registered commands if no arguments are given,
  otherwise print summary of given command.
      <string>  Name of command
  -v, --verbose=<0|1>  If specified, list console commands with given verbose level

status 
  Show current settings and runtime state

stack 
  Stack usage: stack [show] [--headroom BYTES]

disp 
  Display settings: disp show | disp units C|F | disp attn
  show|set|defaults|ack

units 
  Units settings: units set C|F | units gpio show | units gpio set pin <n> |
  units gpio set pull <up|down|none> | units gpio set c_level <high|low>

raw 
  Print one raw reading and calibrated value

flush 
  Force flush FRAM -> SD (best-effort) [--async] [--timeout <ms>]

marker 
  Marker commands: marker show | marker clear

sd 
  SD commands: sd status | sd mount | sd unmount | sd format | sd view | sd
  verify

fram 
  FRAM log commands: fram status | fram show | fram clear

errlog 
  Error log commands: errlog show [--last N] | errlog stats | errlog status |
  errlog clear

log 
  Logging config: log interval <ms> | log watermark <records> | log
  flush_period <ms> | log batch <bytes> | log show

mqtt 
  MQTT settings: mqtt show | mqtt enable on|off | mqtt broker set <uri> | mqtt
  prefix set <prefix> | mqtt qos set 0|1 | mqtt retain set on|off | mqtt bridge
  set off|serial|broker|both
  Note: broker bridge requires mqtt enabled; serial bridge does not.

rtd 
  RTD settings: rtd show | rtd ema show | rtd ema on|off | rtd ema alpha
  <0.0..1.0>

cal  <action> [<raw_c>] [<actual_c>] [--every_ms=<every_ms>] [--seconds=<seconds>] [--stable_stddev_c=<stable_stddev_c>] [--min_seconds=<min_seconds>] [--timeout_seconds=<timeout_seconds>] [--mode=<mode>] [--allow_wide_slope]
  Calibration: cal status | cal set date <YYYY-MM-DD> | cal clear date |
  
  cal set due <count> <days|months|years> | cal clear due |
  cal set due_override <count> <days|months|years> |
  cal clear due_override |
  cal clear | cal add <raw_c> <actual_c> | cal list | cal show |
  
  cal apply [--mode linear|piecewise|polyN] [--allow_wide_slope] |
  
  cal live [--every_ms 500] [--seconds 10] | cal capture <actual_temp_c>
  
  [--stable_stddev_c 0.05] [--min_seconds 5] [--timeout_seconds 120]
  Workflow:
  - cal clear
  - let node settle at reference temp
  - cal live --seconds 10
  - cal capture 0.00 --stable_stddev_c 0.05 --min_seconds 10
  - move to another reference
  - cal capture 100.00 ...
  - cal apply
  - cal show.
  
  Notes: *may want to use boilpt command*; capture uses windowed
  average after stability; live/capture show raw vs average; apply uses
  
  least-squares and reports residuals; calibration invalidates when
  conversion mode, wire count, filter Hz, Rref, R0, or PT100 table
changes.

      <action>  clear|add|list|show|apply|live|capture
       <raw_c>  Raw temperature (C) from 'raw'
    <actual_c>  Actual temperature (C)
  --every_ms=<every_ms>  Live interval (ms)
  --seconds=<seconds>  Live duration (s)
  --stable_stddev_c=<stable_stddev_c>  Capture stable stddev threshold (C)
  --min_seconds=<min_seconds>  Capture min stable time
  --timeout_seconds=<timeout_seconds>  Capture timeout
  --mode=<mode>  Fit mode (linear|piecewise|polyN)
  --allow_wide_slope  Allow slope outside expected bounds

mode  <action> [diag|run]
  mode show | mode run | mode diag | mode set diag|run
      <action>  show|run|diag|set
      diag|run  Target mode

data  <action>
  data show | data on | data off
      <action>  show|on|off

run  <action>
  run status | run start | run stop
      <action>  status|start|stop

tz  <action> [<posix>]
  tz show | tz set "<posix>"
      <action>  show|set
       <posix>  POSIX TZ string

time  <action> [<local_time>] [--is_dst=<0|1>]
  time show
  time setlocal "YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS" [--is_dst 0|1]
  input is LOCAL wall time; converted to UTC epoch + RTC stored as UTC
  local formatting uses current TZ rules (POSIX TZ string via settings)
  use --is_dst to disambiguate fall-back hour
      <action>  setlocal|show
  <local_time>  LOCAL time
  --is_dst=<0|1>  DST disambiguation

rtc 
  rtc status | rtc set period_ms <0..86400000>

boilpt 
  Compute boiling point of water from pressure: boilpt <inHg> [elev_ft]

dst  <action> [<0|1>]
  dst show | dst set 0|1
      <action>  show|set
         <0|1>  DST enabled

role  <action> [<root|sensor|relay>]
  role show | role set root|sensor|relay
      <action>  show|set
  <root|sensor|relay>  Node role

net  <action> [<mesh|wifi|none>]
  net show | net set mesh|wifi|none
      <action>  show|set
  <mesh|wifi|none>  Network mode (mesh|wifi|none)

wifi 
  wifi help | wifi show | wifi set <ssid> [password] | wifi clear | wifi scan
  [--max N] | wifi status | wifi connect [--timeout_ms T] | wifi disconnect |
  wifi ntp status | wifi ntp sync ...

children  <action> [<0|1>]
  children show | children set 0|1
      <action>  show|set
         <0|1>  Allow downstream children

diag 
  Diagnostics entry point

reboot 
  Soft reboot the device

alert 
  Alerting commands: alert status | alert list | alert types | alert enable ...

